    "body": "PR #1498 merged 0783_deal_timeline_lease_read.sql after the 6c346181 worker\nrelease (run 20261003T220008Z-fc609c) had already applied 0785, 0786 and 0787\nto staging and production. The applied ledger (..., 0782, 0785, 0786, 0787)\nwas then no longer a prefix of the source tree (..., 0782, 0783, 0785, ...),\nso the 98080b3c release stopped at staging-prepare with \"partial candidate\nledger is not an exact source prefix\". tools/migrate.py's applied-ledger\ncheck would refuse the same reorder in production. 0783 applied nowhere.\n\nSame shape and fix as #1464 (0757 -> 0763) and #1500 (0769/0770 -> 0785/0786).\n0798 reserved via tools/reserve-migration.py. The file moves unchanged (same\nbytes); the only other edit repoints the local-deals-store test at the new\npath.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <fixture-author@example.invalid>\n",
